# Magnetar live ISO package list.
#
# GENERATED from CachyOS-Live-ISO's packages_desktop.x86_64 by
# tools/gen-iso-packages.py, with the Plasma session removed and COSMIC in
# its place. Regenerate after bumping UPSTREAM_ISO_REF rather than editing
# by hand: CachyOS adds hardware, filesystem and firmware packages to that
# list regularly, and losing one silently is how an ISO stops booting on
# somebody's machine.
#
# Dropped from upstream (23): alacritty bluedevil breeze-gtk cachyos-hello cachyos-kde-settings dolphin kate kcalc kde-gtk-config kinfocenter konsole kscreen kxkb2locale1 partitionmanager plasma-desktop plasma-integration plasma-login-manager plasma-nm plasma-pa plasma-thunderbolt plasma-workspace polkit-kde-agent spectacle
#

